<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <RootNamespace>Txfio</RootNamespace>
    <AssemblyName>Txfio</AssemblyName>
    <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
    <AllowUnsafeBlocks>true</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
    <VersionPrefix>0.3.0</VersionPrefix>
    <PackageId>Txfio</PackageId>
    <Authors>YUKIKEDA</Authors>
    <Description>Transactional file IO for Windows (NTFS/SMB), inspired by git staging and commit.</Description>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2026 YUKIKEDA and contributors</Copyright>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/YUKIKEDA/Txfio</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/YUKIKEDA/Txfio.git</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild Condition="'$(GITHUB_ACTIONS)' == 'true'">true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>
    <PackageTags>filesystem;transaction;windows;ntfs;smb</PackageTags>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
0.3.0 detects a client of another on-disk protocol version instead of letting it corrupt the work folder. No breaking changes.

- Clients that share a work folder need the same protocol version, not the same library version. This release is protocol 1.
- New: IncompatibleClientException. The write operations and RecoverAsync wait within their lock wait, then throw it while a client of another protocol version uses the work folder. Detection works on Windows only.
- Journals record their protocol version. RecoverAsync reports a journal of another protocol version as JournalUnreadable and does not touch it.
- 0.2.0 clients can share a work folder with 0.3.0, but cannot be detected.
- Before upgrading the clients of a work folder, call RecoverAsync with the old version.

Full notes: https://github.com/YUKIKEDA/Txfio/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub" Version="8.0.0" PrivateAssets="All" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Txfio.Tests" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
